          Save your natural tooth and eliminate severe toothache safely. At Aureva Dental on Horamavu Agara Road, our dental surgeons combine rotary nickel-titanium instrumentation, digital RVG diagnostics, and gentle computerized anesthesia for a truly comfortable root canal treatment.
        </p>

        <!-- Action Call and WhatsApp Buttons (Plain <a> tags for GTM tracking) -->
        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-row items-center gap-3 w-full sm:w-auto">
          <a 
